# 🗺️ Announcements
http-request ^https?:\/\/gspe35-ssl\.ls\.apple\.(com|cn)\/config\/announcements script-path=https://gist.githubusercontent.com/VirgilClyne/b7524906119fa250bc933cc9a08e939a/raw/request.dev.bundle.js, tag=🗺️ Maps.config.announcements.request, argument={{{scriptParams}}}
